* dual_infeasible_diag - 2x2 SDP: max <I,X> = tr X s.t. X_12 = 0 (via <A_1,X>=2*X_12=0), X >= 0
* PRIMAL UNBOUNDED (== dual infeasible): the only constraint forces X_12 = 0; the
*   diagonal of X is otherwise free, so tr X is unbounded above on the PSD cone.
* Recession ray Xhat = E_11: <A_1,Xhat> = 0 (A_1 = [[0,1],[1,0]]), <C,Xhat> = 1 > 0,
*   Xhat >= 0 (eigs 1,0).
